#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087868 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087455 :question/id #uuid "6f249bfa-e57b-5784-9da8-d0f9aff213bc" :question/math-academy-id "e-21813" :question/problem "Which of the following first-order linear differential equations are inhomogeneous?\n\n- $y' + x^3 y = 0$\n\n- $y' + x^3 y = x^4$\n\n- $y' + x^3 y = y$" :question/worked-solution "A first-order linear differential equation is homogeneous if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\ny' + P(x)y = 0.\n$$\n\nA first-order linear differential equation is inhomogeneous if it is not homogeneous, i.e., if it can be written as\n\n$$\ny' + P(x)y = Q(x)\n$$\n\nwhere $Q$ is not identical to zero.\n\nTo determine which equations are inhomogeneous, we examine each one in turn.\n\n- First, we consider the equation\n\n$$\ny' + x^3 y = 0.\n$$\n\nNotice that this has the form $y' + P(x)y = 0.$ Therefore, this equation is homogeneous.\n\n- Next, we consider the equation\n\n$$\ny' + x^3 y = x^4.\n$$\n\nNotice that this is written in the form $y' + P(x)y = Q(x)$ where $Q(x) = x^4$ is not identically zero. Therefore, this equation is inhomogeneous.\n\n- Finally, we consider the equation\n\n$$\ny' + x^3 y = y.\n$$\n\nWe collect the $y$-terms on the left side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}+{x}^{3}y & =y \\\\ {y}^{′}+{x}^{3}y-y & =0 \\\\ {y}^{′}+({x}^{3}-1)y & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince our equation can be written in the form $y' + P(x)y = 0,$ the equation is homogeneous.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\""} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "739a8f10-413a-5a1d-a47e-4afd0b14eb44" :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186495311 :question-generator/id #uuid "450e3b4a-65e7-5aec-835d-28f2de8eb585" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186087868.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186088138 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0be2f153-899d-5fb8-ac16-0ba73180f4fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438112} {:answer/id #uuid "ee580a40-60ca-5953-943d-30dd4b11b6d0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438113}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ee580a40-60ca-5953-943d-30dd4b11b6d0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438113} :answer-field/id #uuid "714a626a-fab4-5f20-a46d-51645fc38dbf" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439085} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ec3bd844-d4e8-57ac-ad3b-82c49ec28d2b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438114} {:answer/id #uuid "fea4c07d-5917-52be-8e1b-5dbb2feaab3a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438115}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ec3bd844-d4e8-57ac-ad3b-82c49ec28d2b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438114} :answer-field/id #uuid "ee7df271-7391-5bbb-ab29-fda31dd67139" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439086} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "400d3877-8336-525a-af43-68d24e29fcc6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438116} {:answer/id #uuid "f6217fb0-8460-5778-a259-912ec4c56673" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438117}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f6217fb0-8460-5778-a259-912ec4c56673" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438117} :answer-field/id #uuid "93800a3e-e593-5d63-9351-6a7fe5d4830b" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439087}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "591724df-60a1-5a9d-9f71-6942e86af15b" :question/math-academy-id "q-331601" :question/problem "Which of the following first-order linear differential equations are homogeneous?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** ${y}^{′}+2xy=0$\n- **II.** ${y}^{′}+2xy=4$\n- **III.** ${y}^{′}+2xy=-y$" :question/worked-solution "A first-order linear differential equation is homogeneous if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.\n$$\n\nNow, let's consider each equation in turn.\n\n- First, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+2xy=0.\n$$\n\nThe right-hand side is already zero, so the equation directly matches the form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.$ Therefore, this equation is homogeneous.\n\n- Next, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+2xy=4.\n$$\n\nThe presence of the constant term $4$ means the right-hand side is not zero, and so it cannot be rewritten in homogeneous form. Thus, this equation is *not* homogeneous.\n\n- Finally, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+2xy=-y.\n$$\n\nWe move the term involving $y$ to the left side so that all $y$-terms are together:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}+2xy & =-y \\\\ {y}^{′}+2xy+y & =0 \\\\ {y}^{′}+(2x+1)y & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis matches the homogeneous form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.$  Therefore, this equation *is* homogeneous.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186088139 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2318c126-d9d2-5687-bb8b-918ad14d6156" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438178} {:answer/id #uuid "f518ca95-b74e-5582-89dd-63e8f6153da9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438179}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2318c126-d9d2-5687-bb8b-918ad14d6156" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438178} :answer-field/id #uuid "94ef4ee6-5e52-5c68-8029-62df90194fb8" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439118} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "76f99cb4-2678-54dc-a0dd-8a78eba6fbcf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438180} {:answer/id #uuid "febffbfc-df33-5888-a072-47e28917a6ab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438181}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "76f99cb4-2678-54dc-a0dd-8a78eba6fbcf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438180} :answer-field/id #uuid "02c4c8bf-53a2-53cc-ad28-268a12a0d525" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439119} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e9a725e5-14e8-52a9-acc8-2cbd27718273" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438182} {:answer/id #uuid "b294f791-cc47-542e-8756-d3cb4aad5758" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438183}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b294f791-cc47-542e-8756-d3cb4aad5758" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438183} :answer-field/id #uuid "1129b51c-de6b-5813-afae-1fb7f41b9ec6" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439120}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "d7723c02-822f-5a83-b3af-429d938426d6" :question/math-academy-id "q-331744" :question/problem "Which of the following first-order linear differential equations are inhomogeneous?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** ${y}^{′}-xy=0$\n- **II.** ${y}^{′}-xy=y$\n- **III.** ${y}^{′}-xy={x}^{3}$" :question/worked-solution "A first-order linear differential equation is homogeneous if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.\n$$\n\nA first-order linear differential equation is inhomogeneous if it is not homogeneous, i.e., if it can be written as\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+P(x)y=Q(x)\n$$\n\nwhere $Q$ is not identical to zero.\n\nTo determine which equations are inhomogeneous, we examine each one in turn.\n\n- First, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}-xy=0.\n$$\n\nThe right-hand side is already zero, so the equation directly matches the form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.$ Therefore, this equation is homogeneous.\n\n- Next, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}-xy=y.\n$$\n\nWe move the term involving $y$ to the left side so that all $y$-terms are together:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}-xy & =y \\\\ {y}^{′}-xy-y & =0 \\\\ {y}^{′}-(x+1)y & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis matches the homogeneous form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.$  Therefore, this equation *is* homogeneous.\n\n- Finally, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}-xy={x}^{3}.\n$$\n\nNotice that this is written in the form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=Q(x)$ where $Q(x)={x}^{3}$ is not identically zero. Therefore, this equation is inhomogeneous.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186304927 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ade60bd6-89a3-5a73-972d-872bbec9ef1e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438118} {:answer/id #uuid "3dbc21da-935d-542a-8ab1-73ad0fbda9fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438119}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3dbc21da-935d-542a-8ab1-73ad0fbda9fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438119} :answer-field/id #uuid "0358c23b-ddd3-5e03-9d10-c033127c1b43" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439088} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f3efe629-e162-5be1-b2a1-ef4c42a89b88" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438120} {:answer/id #uuid "a45bc3bf-30fc-52e0-93fe-132d6f93b6c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438121}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f3efe629-e162-5be1-b2a1-ef4c42a89b88" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438120} :answer-field/id #uuid "3dfb15d0-be1a-5c7b-a003-222aab29fafc" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439089} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5508790c-26b9-5808-affc-0f5c42fd9819" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438122} {:answer/id #uuid "40377e57-9072-5c7f-9b8d-750b0bacdd09" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438123}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5508790c-26b9-5808-affc-0f5c42fd9819" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438122} :answer-field/id #uuid "118e5a32-cc2b-560d-ac23-990fe960a18c" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439090}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "52b69d13-8d12-5e35-b5cc-e11a7f6b65a8" :question/math-academy-id "q-331605" :question/problem "Which of the following first-order linear differential equations are inhomogeneous?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** ${y}^{′}+{x}^{2}y=3x$\n- **II.** ${y}^{′}+{x}^{2}y=0$\n- **III.** ${y}^{′}+{x}^{2}y=y$" :question/worked-solution "A first-order linear differential equation is homogeneous if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.\n$$\n\nA first-order linear differential equation is inhomogeneous if it is not homogeneous, i.e., if it can be written as\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+P(x)y=Q(x)\n$$\n\nwhere $Q$ is not identical to zero.\n\nTo determine which equations are inhomogeneous, we examine each one in turn.\n\n- First, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+{x}^{2}y=3x.\n$$\n\nNotice that this is written in the form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=Q(x)$ where $Q(x)=3x$ is not identically zero. Therefore, this equation is inhomogeneous.\n\n- Next, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+{x}^{2}y=0.\n$$\n\nNotice that this equation has the form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.$ Therefore, this equation is homogeneous.\n\n- Finally, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+{x}^{2}y=y.\n$$\n\nWe collect the $y$-terms on the left side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}+{x}^{2}y & =y \\\\ {y}^{′}+{x}^{2}y-y & =0 \\\\ {y}^{′}+({x}^{2}-1)y & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince our equation can be written in the form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=0,$ the equation is homogeneous.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186304935 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ff0321f7-e164-5498-b196-4c286eaf7bce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438124} {:answer/id #uuid "ba350085-c43f-5ce4-8a62-63ec28159573" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438125}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ff0321f7-e164-5498-b196-4c286eaf7bce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438124} :answer-field/id #uuid "3d7d5355-19b7-54c4-8b09-d85e8e57729e" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439091} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7e337d58-491f-5879-bf5b-e65fb1c3eb1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438126} {:answer/id #uuid "0da375b9-4261-5cc0-b3fe-b7c866eea9c8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438127}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0da375b9-4261-5cc0-b3fe-b7c866eea9c8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438127} :answer-field/id #uuid "a0e14497-143c-5934-8cfa-95c35be4fb08" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439092} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "89b67917-bd3d-5f65-9067-a429d1042297" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438128} {:answer/id #uuid "98208928-1e1c-5c7d-aa97-3ae58d1c5cfb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438129}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "98208928-1e1c-5c7d-aa97-3ae58d1c5cfb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438129} :answer-field/id #uuid "2af9d526-9783-5010-9162-846dfff432a0" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439093}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "3ed9d4c5-c8ba-5702-acc9-702d6e5cd248" :question/math-academy-id "q-331724" :question/problem "Which of the following first-order linear differential equations are homogeneous?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** ${y}^{′}+2{x}^{3}y={x}^{2}$\n- **II.** ${y}^{′}+2{x}^{3}y=-3y$\n- **III.** ${y}^{′}+2{x}^{3}y=0$" :question/worked-solution "A first-order linear differential equation is homogeneous if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.\n$$\n\nNow, let's consider each equation in turn.\n\n- First, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+2{x}^{3}y={x}^{2}.\n$$\n\nNotice that this is written in the form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=Q(x)$ where $Q(x)={x}^{2}$ is not identically zero. Therefore, this equation is inhomogeneous.\n\n- Next, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+2{x}^{3}y=-3y.\n$$\n\nWe move the term involving $y$ to the left side so that all $y$-terms are together:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}+2{x}^{3}y & =-3y \\\\ {y}^{′}+2{x}^{3}y+3y & =0 \\\\ {y}^{′}+(2{x}^{3}+3)y & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis matches the homogeneous form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.$  Therefore, this equation *is* homogeneous.\n\n- Finally, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+2{x}^{3}y=0.\n$$\n\nThe right-hand side is already zero, so the equation directly matches the form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.$ Therefore, this equation is homogeneous.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186304936 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "22b30a22-e8bf-521c-90a6-3f4a193abff7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438130} {:answer/id #uuid "21794aaa-14c3-5e8a-bbaa-2761662e74b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438131}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "21794aaa-14c3-5e8a-bbaa-2761662e74b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438131} :answer-field/id #uuid "0dd5b6aa-8b92-5f0c-ad2c-a55d462aa082" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439094} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ab3067f1-1415-59b1-8610-cf2333e9d171" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438132} {:answer/id #uuid "7a90b93a-6c14-52f2-bdf3-931241711cf2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438133}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7a90b93a-6c14-52f2-bdf3-931241711cf2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438133} :answer-field/id #uuid "9a1dfa1a-de10-5f44-9760-65dd587cb80b" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439095} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2d659f16-e228-5cec-abc7-98ba7fc32f19" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438134} {:answer/id #uuid "5438dd0d-7002-5197-8393-206d7d4887ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438135}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5438dd0d-7002-5197-8393-206d7d4887ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438135} :answer-field/id #uuid "2c171570-be09-53d8-bdb3-f8add2aaf918" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439096}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "a4c450ce-db9f-5997-8c48-e9942b8b8389" :question/math-academy-id "q-331725" :question/problem "Which of the following first-order linear differential equations are homogeneous?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** ${y}^{′}-xy=-y$\n- **II.** ${y}^{′}-xy=0$\n- **III.** ${y}^{′}-xy=-5y$" :question/worked-solution "A first-order linear differential equation is homogeneous if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.\n$$\n\nNow, let's consider each equation in turn.\n\n- First, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}-xy=-y.\n$$\n\nWe move the term involving $y$ to the left side so that all $y$-terms are together:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}-xy & =-y \\\\ {y}^{′}-xy+y & =0 \\\\ {y}^{′}-(x-1)y & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis matches the homogeneous form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.$  Therefore, this equation *is* homogeneous.\n\n- Next, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}-xy=0.\n$$\n\nThe right-hand side is already zero, so the equation directly matches the form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.$ Therefore, this equation is homogeneous.\n\n- Finally, we consider the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}-xy=-5y.\n$$\n\nWe move the term involving $y$ to the left side so that all $y$-terms are together:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}-xy & =-5y \\\\ {y}^{′}-xy+5y & =0 \\\\ {y}^{′}-(x-5)y & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis matches the homogeneous form ${y}^{′}+P(x)y=0.$  Therefore, this equation *is* homogeneous.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II and III.\""} 